---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Contribute"
description: "Suggest a quote, drill, book, parable, idiom, or poem. Leave a testimonial. Send a thank-you note. Help shape GuerillaType."
permalink: /contribute/
---

<div class="contribute-hub">
  <header class="contribute-hub__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Help shape the project</p>
    <h1>Contribute</h1>
    <p class="article-lede">GuerillaType grows when you push it. Suggest content for the library, leave a review, or send a quick thanks. Every form comes straight to my inbox -- no account, no tracking.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="contribute-hub__section">
    <h2>Suggest content</h2>
    <p class="muted">Public-domain only. Source links speed things up.</p>
    <div class="contribute-hub__grid">
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/quote/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">❝</span>
        <h3>Suggest a quote</h3>
        <p>A line worth typing -- author, year, source.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/book/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">B</span>
        <h3>Suggest a book</h3>
        <p>Public-domain classic with a Project Gutenberg URL.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/parable/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">F</span>
        <h3>Suggest a parable</h3>
        <p>Aesop, Zen koan, folk fable, moral story.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/idiom/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">I</span>
        <h3>Suggest an idiom</h3>
        <p>Phrase, meaning, origin, region.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/poem/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">P</span>
        <h3>Suggest a poem</h3>
        <p>Pre-1928 only. Sonnets, lyrics, narrative.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card" href="/contribute/drill/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">D</span>
        <h3>Suggest a drill</h3>
        <p>Key cluster, bigram, finger isolation, symbol pack.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contribute-hub__section">
    <h2>Share feedback</h2>
    <p class="muted">Tell other typists why they should be here. Or just say hi.</p>
    <div class="contribute-hub__grid">
      <a class="contribute-card contribute-card--accent" href="/contribute/testimonial/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">★</span>
        <h3>Leave a testimonial</h3>
        <p>Rate the site, share what you love, opt in to be quoted on /reviews/.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="contribute-card contribute-card--accent" href="/contribute/thanks-note/">
        <span class="contribute-card__chip">♥</span>
        <h3>Send a thanks note</h3>
        <p>A quick message of appreciation. Lands on the wall when approved.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contribute-hub__section">
    <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
    <ul class="contribute-hub__list">
      <li><strong>Open a GitHub issue</strong> for bug reports or feature requests at <a href="{{ site.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.repo }}</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Star the repo</strong> if GuerillaType made your typing better -- it pushes the project up search rankings for free.</li>
      <li><strong>Send PRs</strong> for new wordlists, lessons, drills, or curated text packs. PRs are reviewed within a few days.</li>
      <li><strong>Tell a friend.</strong> Word of mouth keeps free, no-account tools alive.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
